# Era 5, The Clearance: places, people, households, fates, self-lies, lore and the clearance fight. Year 115,
# forty-five winters after era 4: three weeks in spring. Danil Saro is dead under a sergeant's knee before the era
# opens; the council votes to clear the Upper Town for the ring road; Haldane Yard is cleared or stood down; the
# archive opens; the town commemorates "the hard winter"; the table stands in an antique shop's window.
# Story lead, 2026-10-23. DRAFT: every line in era 5 waits for the author's line approval (ledger row S14).
# Design: design/eras/era5.md; design/spine-plan/DECISIONS-2026-10-22.md (era questions 4 and 5).
# Two classes play it: the Inspector line is Tom Furrowe (33), the council's housing inspector, Nan's son; the
# Militia line is Sergeant Leon Brack (40), Ann's son, the man in the clip.
# Files: e5_world (this), e5_town (s01 to s05), e5_vote (s06 to s10), e5_day (s11 to s14), e5_end (s15, s16 and the
# witness that is a table), e5_week (the viewing room, after the tea, the funeral, the panel or the interview, the
# packing, the other doors, the ceremony). The era 4 to 5 link is the single alt in e4_witness.lwd (e4.w.mira.next goes to
# e5.start); era 4's e4.end is removed; the game ends at e5.end (q.end).
# Plates: the seventeen q5_* places are areas on their own plates (plates agent, 2026-10-23; render/places/q5_*.mjs,
# game/engine/wiring/era5-areas.lwd), with April's hours and weather on the HUD (@meta hud-held, var.era == 5). The
# clip plays inside the phone's frame (e5.clip.stop, camera: phone; game/engine/ui/phoneframe.mjs).
# Not built here: the inner arena fights (Everybody Says for both lines, Order for Leon, the Descent and the
# Adversary; the self-lies below arm them), the q5_haldane_yard arena and a bailiff boss pattern (e.e5_door borrows
# the granary's ground and the captain). Built since (2026-10-23): tools/endingcheck.mjs, one harness route per class
# and movement (tools/quota/policy.mjs; the movement is a plain choice in e5.move), and era5.md section 7's props as
# @prop (the new ones at the end of this file; the five that persist stand at their era 5 places by in:, q_props.lwd).
# Weighted-devices pass, 2026-10-23 (design/device-audit/era5.md): the senses, the echoes that show each era 5 fate, the
# cap on the Brack kitchen's nail are at the end; the voices that carry posts (LAD, LEAGUE, PHONE, NEIGHBOUR) are with the people.

